      </ul> </div> <!-- SINGLE CTA --> <div class="cta-section"> <h3>See ioNova ARS in action</h3> <p>The complete ISO 20022 Postal Address &mdash; Requirements and Specifications Update 2026 consolidates the CPMI harmonisation requirements, the BIS PIE taskforce report, the PMPG Hybrid Postal Address whitepaper and the EPC address guidance into a single reference.</p> <a class="btn btn-accent" href="https://ionova.ai/demo">Book a demo <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></a> </div> </section> <section class="section"> <div class="section-label">Related Terms</div> <h2 class="section-title">See also</h2> <div class="related-grid"> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/twnnm-ctry"><h4>TwnNm and Ctry</h4><p>TwnNm (max 35 chars) and Ctry (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2) are the two mandatory elements of every compliant ISO 20022…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/iso-3166-codes"><h4>ISO 3166 codes</h4><p>Ctry must carry a two-letter ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code ([A-Z]&#123;2&#125;); CtrySubDvsn uses ISO 3166-2 codes such as US-…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/sepa-sct-addresses"><h4>SEPA structured addresses</h4><p>EPC rulebooks made Ctry mandatory in SCT from November 2025; TwnNm follows at the November 2026 cutover, when …</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/straight-through-processing"><h4>Straight-through processing (STP)</h4><p>STP is automated payment processing without manual intervention. Cross-border baselines sit near 40%; ioNova A…</p></a> </div> </section> </article>
